        <Summary>
            <ul>
                <li>Test the handoff: the operator sees the cash order, and the owner sees it reflected on the dashboard.</li>
                <li>Share one AppHost and disposable database per test assembly, but use a fresh browser context and unique records per test.</li>
                <li>Use the failed assertion and a test-named recording to work out what went wrong after a run.</li>
            </ul>
